  "detection_method": "Monitor CI/CD pipeline logs for unexpected postinstall or lifecycle script executions in dependencies. Use software composition analysis (SCA) to verify integrity and provenance of dependencies. Network monitoring for anomalous HTTPS POST traffic to unknown external endpoints from build servers. Implement runtime behavior analysis to detect outbound exfiltration attempts from build agents.",
  "relevant_mitre_techniques": [
